{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122289","id":4251536180,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc79aUs0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122289","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122289.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122289.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122289","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122289/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122289/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122289/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/24c68da288e46621c87f2450cfb04c11019052e8","number":122289,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"GDExtension: Copy and null-terminate buffer in XMLParser open_buffer binding ","user":{"login":"Karticoder","id":168813500,"node_id":"U_kgDOCg_jvA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168813500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder","html_url":"https://github.com/Karticoder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Karticoder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"While poking around gdextension_xml_parser_open_buffer I saw it was shoving the raw extension‑supplied buffer straight into _open_buffer. That internal guy just assumes the buffer is already null‑terminated and will stay alive forever—neither of which is really true for data coming from outside the engine. \r\n\r\nIf the extension didn't null‑terminate, the parser would happily walk off the end; if the extension freed the buffer early, we'd get a sweet use‑after‑free. I just made the wrapper copy the bytes into a temp vector and call the public open_buffer instead. That does a safe copy + null‑termination and owns the memory from there on.\r\n\r\n There’s a tiny double‑copy happening but it’s harmless and I left a note about it so nobody freaks out later. Also threw in a test that feeds a non‑null‑terminated buffer into open_buffer to make sure it holds.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akie